/*
Flora Spline
Made for #WCCChallenge topic "Botanical 🌴"

Click to generate new output, press "s" to save screenshot

Drawing 3D splines is so fun:)

inspired by 0490 by kusakari
https://openprocessing.org/sketch/1491064

